{"vid":"WxkEk1n5sXM","source":"WxkEk1n5sXM.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"Hey, welcome to the shop. So, today I'm"},{"t":1.8,"txt":"doing long needed update to the"},{"t":3.5,"txt":"fabrication area to be able to work a"},{"t":5.2,"txt":"little more efficiently. Let me show you"},{"t":6.6,"txt":"what I'm doing. My workshop is just in"},{"t":8.3,"txt":"the side of my garage here, so it's"},{"t":9.8,"txt":"pretty space limited. So, the welding"},{"t":11.9,"txt":"area has been set up pretty well for a"},{"t":13.2,"txt":"while. Next to that are the stationary"},{"t":15.3,"txt":"tools I use the most. I have the drill"},{"t":16.8,"txt":"press on the stand that I built, as well"},{"t":19.4,"txt":"as the chop saw on that cart that I"},{"t":22,"txt":"built that captures all the chips. But,"},{"t":24.2,"txt":"in between those, I've created a spot"},{"t":26.8,"txt":"for two of my most commonly used"},{"t":28.7,"txt":"stationary tools that I kept on a shelf"},{"t":30.6,"txt":"before. That's my belt grinder that I"},{"t":32.7,"txt":"built in a recent video, and my uh"},{"t":36,"txt":"PortaBand table right there. In the"},{"t":38.3,"txt":"past, I've had to get them out to use"},{"t":39.8,"txt":"them. I want to build a table for them"},{"t":41.5,"txt":"to sit on. I'm going to start off with"},{"t":43.2,"txt":"this toolbox topper that I found at the"},{"t":44.9,"txt":"hardware store, and it has just enough"},{"t":46.8,"txt":"room for both tools to be able to sit"},{"t":49,"txt":"there on the bench. They'll be packed in"},{"t":51.2,"txt":"really tightly, but I can pull them off"},{"t":52.9,"txt":"of here if I need more room around them"},{"t":55.1,"txt":"for a particular project. So, I think"},{"t":57,"txt":"it'll work pretty well."},{"t":58.8,"txt":"I need to go pick up some steel to be"},{"t":60.8,"txt":"able to build the frame around it, and I"},{"t":63,"txt":"have a few different steel suppliers"},{"t":64.5,"txt":"that I use for different things, and"},{"t":66.1,"txt":"it's good to know who's in your area"},{"t":67.7,"txt":"depending on what you need."},{"t":69.6,"txt":"I'm using some 16-gauge. That's right"},{"t":71.5,"txt":"around 1/16 of an inch, or 1 and 1/2 mm"},{"t":74,"txt":"thick, square tubing, and it's an inch"},{"t":76.3,"txt":"and a half size tube. I just need one"},{"t":79.8,"txt":"20-ft length to be able to make this"},{"t":81.6,"txt":"whole project, and I should be able to"},{"t":83.3,"txt":"do it without a whole lot of bracing."},{"t":85.5,"txt":"So, the first thing that I need to do is"},{"t":87.3,"txt":"create a perimeter about a half inch in"},{"t":89.5,"txt":"from the outside edge of the wood, and"},{"t":92.4,"txt":"so that means a whole bunch of miter"},{"t":94.5,"txt":"cuts here to fit it all in place."},{"t":97.5,"txt":"The Sieg miter table is going to be a"},{"t":98.7,"txt":"big time saver here, but you could build"},{"t":100.8,"txt":"this just using a regular speed square,"},{"t":104.5,"txt":"and tacking everything in bumping it"},{"t":105.9,"txt":"around till it's square. I've done"},{"t":107.4,"txt":"plenty that way as well."},{"t":109.4,"txt":"Now, if everything is sitting parallel,"},{"t":111.5,"txt":"I'll just check corner to corner to make"},{"t":113.2,"txt":"sure it's square. That should be good"},{"t":115.1,"txt":"enough for what I'm doing here."},{"t":117.3,"txt":"It's important to put some tacks on the"},{"t":118.9,"txt":"inside and the outside and don't go"},{"t":121.1,"txt":"overboard with the size of tack when"},{"t":122.6,"txt":"you're dealing with this thin-walled"},{"t":123.8,"txt":"tubing."},{"t":125,"txt":"Notice I'm welding from the inside to"},{"t":126.8,"txt":"the outside and this will tend to pull"},{"t":130,"txt":"things open because when you weld the"},{"t":132.5,"txt":"inner fillet weld, it'll pull it closed"},{"t":134.5,"txt":"and it usually works out about right"},{"t":136.5,"txt":"kind of canceling out that residual"},{"t":138,"txt":"stress. Though with everything clamped"},{"t":139.8,"txt":"down, it's not as big of a deal."},{"t":142.2,"txt":"Now notice I welded one side and then"},{"t":144.6,"txt":"I'm going to clamp it down and weld the"},{"t":146.4,"txt":"other butt joint there on the other side"},{"t":149.5,"txt":"cuz once those two are locked in place,"},{"t":151.6,"txt":"the fillet weld won't pull it a whole"},{"t":153.4,"txt":"lot and it'll remain pretty square"},{"t":155.9,"txt":"without being clamped down and"},{"t":157.8,"txt":"constrained."},{"t":167.1,"txt":"Well, I ground the other side completely"},{"t":168.6,"txt":"flush to sit against the tabletop. On"},{"t":170.6,"txt":"this side, I'll just grind down the"},{"t":172.1,"txt":"inside and outside so they can sit"},{"t":174.2,"txt":"inside the tubing that'll act as legs."},{"t":177.7,"txt":"Because of the size of tubing I'm using,"},{"t":179.6,"txt":"I'm not going to use any bracing. I'll"},{"t":181.1,"txt":"just put it directly on and I'm using"},{"t":183.6,"txt":"these squares to hold it in place while"},{"t":185.5,"txt":"I tack it."},{"t":187.1,"txt":"If I had really tight dimensional"},{"t":188.8,"txt":"requirements or if I were welding on"},{"t":191.7,"txt":"thicker material, I would clamp"},{"t":193.4,"txt":"everything and constrain it while I"},{"t":195.3,"txt":"welded it out. But from my experience"},{"t":198,"txt":"with this thinner material, as long as"},{"t":199.6,"txt":"you don't get overboard with your welds,"},{"t":201.9,"txt":"it usually stays pretty straight. So it"},{"t":203.5,"txt":"should be okay as long as I get some"},{"t":204.8,"txt":"good tack welds on there."},{"t":209.2,"txt":"At this point, it's just a matter of"},{"t":210.6,"txt":"welding everything out. I can start off"},{"t":213,"txt":"with these outside groove welds and that"},{"t":216.5,"txt":"will hold everything in place so it"},{"t":218,"txt":"doesn't warp as much when I weld those"},{"t":219.8,"txt":"inner fillets and it should sit straight"},{"t":221.8,"txt":"enough for what I need to do."},{"t":224,"txt":"On the outside corner on this thin"},{"t":225.5,"txt":"tubing, a vertical down weld is going to"},{"t":227.3,"txt":"work pretty well for me. I'm lining up"},{"t":229.9,"txt":"the the drill to be able to put the"},{"t":231.9,"txt":"holes through to secure the top. It"},{"t":234.4,"txt":"would be easier to just use a hand"},{"t":235.9,"txt":"drill, except it's kind of hard for me"},{"t":237.6,"txt":"to keep that straight vertical and get"},{"t":239.7,"txt":"the upper hole lined up with the bottom"},{"t":241.4,"txt":"one. And since I have a mag drill here,"},{"t":243.6,"txt":"might as well use it."},{"t":245.8,"txt":"Well, the Amazon van showed up just in"},{"t":247.5,"txt":"time with these adjustable feet that I"},{"t":249.2,"txt":"ordered yesterday to be able to put on"},{"t":251.1,"txt":"the bottom and level everything out. In"},{"t":253.7,"txt":"order to do this, I'm going to cap the"},{"t":255.2,"txt":"bottom with some thicker material that I"},{"t":257.1,"txt":"had in place. It's already an inch and a"},{"t":258.7,"txt":"half wide and I'll drill and tap some"},{"t":261.1,"txt":"holes to thread these feet into and make"},{"t":263.2,"txt":"it adjustable."},{"t":264.8,"txt":"I just need to cut them to be squares"},{"t":267.4,"txt":"and then I can drill some holes through"},{"t":270.4,"txt":"the center."},{"t":271.7,"txt":"I could do this with a variety of tools,"},{"t":274.1,"txt":"but the milling machine makes it a"},{"t":275.6,"txt":"little easier to measure everything out"},{"t":277.6,"txt":"in the center and get a repeatable"},{"t":279.4,"txt":"result."},{"t":283.4,"txt":"I could just tap these on the mill, but"},{"t":284.9,"txt":"I didn't want to change the tap and the"},{"t":286.4,"txt":"drill out uh over and over again to get"},{"t":289.4,"txt":"all of them lined up just right. So, I'm"},{"t":291.2,"txt":"going to hand tap them and use this"},{"t":292.6,"txt":"little guide. Now, this is super handy"},{"t":294.6,"txt":"to keep everything straight and it"},{"t":296.9,"txt":"worked out just fine."},{"t":300.1,"txt":"I'm thinking by the time I'm 50, I'll"},{"t":301.7,"txt":"probably remember to put my work clamp"},{"t":303.2,"txt":"on, but uh I'm not there yet. Anyway,"},{"t":306.5,"txt":"with that in place, it's just pretty"},{"t":308.3,"txt":"simple to weld these right there in"},{"t":309.8,"txt":"place. Now, since these are so much"},{"t":311.6,"txt":"thicker than the tubing, I'm focusing"},{"t":314.3,"txt":"most of my heat on the thicker material"},{"t":316.2,"txt":"and letting it just roll onto the other."},{"t":318.4,"txt":"A quick black rattle can treatment to"},{"t":320.1,"txt":"make everything look real nice will"},{"t":322.3,"txt":"finish it off."},{"t":323.9,"txt":"Now, I can attach the top just with some"},{"t":325.7,"txt":"screws. A little bit of pre-drill makes"},{"t":327.8,"txt":"them go in nicely without splitting"},{"t":330,"txt":"anything."},{"t":336.8,"txt":"The leveling feet threaded in really"},{"t":338.4,"txt":"nicely into those holes and then I have"},{"t":340,"txt":"that extra nut that I can use as a jam"},{"t":341.9,"txt":"nut to keep everything locked in place"},{"t":344,"txt":"once I get it sitting nice and level."},{"t":346.1,"txt":"And it fits just right in the spot that"},{"t":347.8,"txt":"I wanted without taking up too much"},{"t":349.7,"txt":"space."},{"t":351.2,"txt":"I'm able to just set my belt grinder"},{"t":352.8,"txt":"there. It hasn't walked around much on"},{"t":354.5,"txt":"me in all the time that I've used it."},{"t":357.1,"txt":"However, the portable band saw table, it"},{"t":359.7,"txt":"does tend to move around. So, I want"},{"t":361.3,"txt":"some way to hold it in place and I want"},{"t":364.6,"txt":"it to also be quickly removable. So, I'm"},{"t":366.6,"txt":"not just going to put some screws"},{"t":367.8,"txt":"through those holes. What I came up with"},{"t":370.2,"txt":"are these little toggle clamps. I just"},{"t":371.9,"txt":"bought them over at Harbor Freight and"},{"t":373.9,"txt":"I'll screw those down, try to arrange"},{"t":376,"txt":"them such that they can hold the thing"},{"t":377.6,"txt":"in place just like that. That'll make it"},{"t":379.9,"txt":"easily removable so I can use it there"},{"t":383.6,"txt":"or move it if I need more room around it"},{"t":385.9,"txt":"for a particular project. I'm really"},{"t":388,"txt":"happy with how this turned out. Thanks a"},{"t":389.8,"txt":"ton for tuning in. If you enjoy this"},{"t":391.8,"txt":"video, let me know by hitting that"},{"t":393,"txt":"thumbs up or leave me a comment. We'll"},{"t":394.9,"txt":"see you next time."}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"Hey,"},{"t":0.48,"w":"welcome"},{"t":0.76,"w":"to"},{"t":0.8,"w":"the"},{"t":0.92,"w":"shop."},{"t":1.24,"w":"So,"},{"t":1.4,"w":"today"},{"t":1.64,"w":"I'm"},{"t":1.76,"w":"doing"},{"t":2,"w":"long"},{"t":2.28,"w":"needed"},{"t":2.6,"w":"update"},{"t":3.12,"w":"to"},{"t":3.24,"w":"the"},{"t":3.48,"w":"fabrication"},{"t":4.2,"w":"area"},{"t":4.52,"w":"to"},{"t":4.6,"w":"be"},{"t":4.72,"w":"able"},{"t":4.84,"w":"to"},{"t":4.92,"w":"work"},{"t":5.12,"w":"a"},{"t":5.16,"w":"little"},{"t":5.36,"w":"more"},{"t":5.52,"w":"efficiently."},{"t":6.12,"w":"Let"},{"t":6.28,"w":"me"},{"t":6.36,"w":"show"},{"t":6.52,"w":"you"},{"t":6.64,"w":"what"},{"t":6.72,"w":"I'm"},{"t":6.8,"w":"doing."},{"t":7.16,"w":"My"},{"t":7.36,"w":"workshop"},{"t":7.8,"w":"is"},{"t":7.96,"w":"just"},{"t":8.2,"w":"in"},{"t":8.28,"w":"the"},{"t":8.36,"w":"side"},{"t":8.6,"w":"of"},{"t":8.68,"w":"my"},{"t":8.8,"w":"garage"},{"t":9.28,"w":"here,"},{"t":9.52,"w":"so"},{"t":9.68,"w":"it's"},{"t":9.84,"w":"pretty"},{"t":10.16,"w":"space"},{"t":10.64,"w":"limited."},{"t":11.36,"w":"So,"},{"t":11.48,"w":"the"},{"t":11.56,"w":"welding"},{"t":11.88,"w":"area"},{"t":12.08,"w":"has"},{"t":12.16,"w":"been"},{"t":12.36,"w":"set"},{"t":12.56,"w":"up"},{"t":12.68,"w":"pretty"},{"t":12.88,"w":"well"},{"t":13.08,"w":"for"},{"t":13.2,"w":"a"},{"t":13.24,"w":"while."},{"t":1